<section class="section" id="vallore-science"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span><h2 class="h2-serif">Less dry skin. A routine worth keeping.</h2><p style="margin:16px 0 28px;max-width:680px">For the dad getting ready before everyone wakes up. For the man stepping back into the photo. Start with a simple moisturizing habit.</p><div class="vl-science-grid"><article><b>01 · After you wash</b><h3>Keep moisture close.</h3><p>Apply moisturizer to slightly damp skin. Rich moisturizers help hold water in the skin, reducing the dry, tight feeling after cleansing.</p></article><article><b>02 · Keep it simple</b><h3>A little, every day.</h3><p>Warm a small amount between your fingers and spread a thin layer over dry areas. Start small and adjust to your skin.</p></article><article><b>03 · Make it yours</b><h3>One habit by the sink.</h3><p>Pair moisturizing with washing your face. A routine you repeat is easier to keep than a shelf full of steps.</p></article></div><div style="margin-top:28px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #d9c9ae;border-radius:16px"><span class="eyebrow">THE SCIENCE OF MOISTURIZING</span><h3 style="margin:10px 0">Dermatologist guidance, explained simply.</h3><p>The American Academy of Dermatology recommends creams or ointments for dry skin and applying moisturizer while skin is still damp. This guidance supports moisturizing; it is not an endorsement of Vallore or evidence of product-specific anti-aging results.</p><a href="https://www.aad.org/public/everyday-care/skin-care-basics/dry/dermatologists-tips-relieve-dry-skin" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="text-decoration:underline">Read the AAD dry-skin guidance</a></div></div></section>
<style>.vl-science-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}.vl-science-grid article{background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #e4d8c5;border-radius:18px;padding:26px}.vl-science-grid h3{margin:12px 0}.template-product .ba{display:flex!important;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;gap:24px;padding-bottom:22px}.template-product .ba>.ba__c{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 48px)/3);min-width:0;scroll-snap-align:start}@media(max-width:749px){.vl-science-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.template-product .ba>.ba__c{flex-basis:90%}.template-product .ba{gap:16px}}</style>

